# Raw job logs are not tracked: 1,200+ .out files, 14 MB, and they are process
# output rather than anything authored.
#
# Two exceptions, both small:
#   README.md      the archive policy — including which folder must not be
#                  pruned, since archive/20260806/ is the only surviving copy of
#                  alllocus_run.
#   manifests/     the ONLY job_id -> (run, drug, exact command) mapping there
#                  is. squeue job names carry no run prefix, so nothing else
#                  disambiguates a job across full_run / full_run_v2 /
#                  alllocus_run — and results/experiments/alllocus_run/
#                  reconstruct_from_logs.py cannot rebuild a lost run without
#                  them. Provenance, not results. ~1 MB for 89 sweeps.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!manifests/*.json
